summary: Early source foundation for Shiptron's local spec-and-build workflow and a themed dashboard.
---

This archive entry records the early source foundation for a local agent
workflow and Vite dashboard. Its current CLI and dashboard support spec,
planning, isolated-worktree build, QA, and review paths. The project does not
automatically merge, publish a release, or connect an external tracker or CI
provider; the operator inspects the worktree and chooses merge or discard.
